  "critique": {
    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Strong dark technical art direction, crisp cyan/green status accents, and clear query-to-outcome hierarchy across all viewports. The precedent card is polished and responsive, but desktop composition is left-heavy with an awkwardly detached results artifact, mobile becomes excessively tall with repetitive rows, and the translucent global header shows distracting underlying text while clipping navigation and dropping the brand name on mobile. Several secondary labels are also very small and low-contrast.",
